# 统一行尾策略：入库 LF，检出按平台；避免补丁工具反复整文件改写行尾
* text=auto
*.go text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.mod text eol=lf
*.sum text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

# 二进制产物
*.wasm binary
*.7z binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
